<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="de"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"/&gt;
    &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;Some Website&lt;/title&gt;
     &lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;


&lt;div id="split-container" class="xl:h-[calc(100vh-60px)] flex flex-col xl:flex-row relative justify-end w-full"&gt;

    &lt;div id="left-border" class="left-border inset-0 absolute z-3 bg-white xl:w-[90%] h-full order-1"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div id="panel-left" class="left left-0 w-full xl:w-[90%] xl:h-full relative xl:absolute z-4 order-3 xl:order-2"&gt;

        &lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1449824913935-59a10b8d2000?w=1200"
             alt=""
             title=""
             class="absolute inset-0 object-cover object-center opacity-20 block h-full w-full"
        /&gt;

        &lt;div class="w-full xl:max-w-[calc(100vw/2)] flex justify-center"&gt;
            &lt;div class="inner"&gt;
                &lt;div class="logo"&gt;
                    Some Logo left
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class="text"&gt;
                    &lt;p&gt;Er hörte leise Schritte hinter sich. Das bedeutete nichts Gutes. Wer würde ihm schon folgen, spät
